===Shark drop table===
Various bosses and high level monsters such as [[Phantom Muspah]], [[drake]]s, and [[Larran's big chest]] access a table that can yield raw sharks, shark lures, or another fish which varies between sources. The alternate fish is raw in some cases and cooked in others, depending on the source, but the sharks are always raw.

The shark lures always drop in double the quantities raw sharks can drop, so if the table has a drop of 1-3 raw sharks, then it can also drop 2, 4, or 6 shark lures (not 3 or 5). The non-shark fish always drops in the same quantities as raw sharks.

